175-## 8. Event-to-statistic mapping
176-
177-This is the inverse of §7, for traceability:
178-
179-- **Delivery** → runs scored, balls faced, strike rate, boundaries, runs
180-  conceded, economy rate, team total, all season/career aggregates.
181-- **Wicket** (+ fielders) → wickets taken, dismissal-kind breakdowns, catch/
182-  run-out tallies for fielders.
183-- **Extra** → runs conceded, balls faced exclusion rule, team total.
184-- **Innings penalty** → team total only (this is the one statistic that
185-  cannot be derived from deliveries alone — property O7).
186-- **Miscounted-over note** → legal-balls-per-over, and therefore overs
187-  bowled and economy rate.
188-- **Powerplay marker** → powerplay-scoped aggregates only.
189-- **Fixture outcome** → win/loss/tie/no-result reporting; not used in any
190-  player statistic.
191-- **Review, Replacement** → not currently mapped to any Basic or
147-**Events.** `delivery`; `delivery_wicket`; `delivery_wicket_fielder`;
148-`delivery_review`; `delivery_replacement`.
